[01:50.43]One sound one single sound
[01:50.43]一声 仅此一声
[01:55.47]One kiss one single kiss
[01:55.47]一吻 仅此一吻
[02:00.24]A face outside the window pane
[02:00.24]窗玻璃外一张脸
[02:05.05]However did it come to this
[02:05.05]怎会沦落至此境
[02:10.16]A man who ran a child who cried
[02:10.16]奔逃的男人 哭泣的孩童
[02:15.31]A girl who heard a voice that lied
[02:15.31]耳畔谎言的少女
[02:20.34]The sun that burned a fiery red
[02:20.34]赤红灼烧的烈日
[02:25.39]The vision of an empty bed
[02:25.39]空荡床榻的幻影
[02:30.75]
[02:51.05]The use of force he was so tough
[02:51.05]他用暴力彰显强硬
[02:55.93]She'll soon submit she's had enough
[02:55.93]她终屈服 忍无可忍
[03:01.43]The march of fate the broken will
[03:01.43]命运行进 意志崩殒
[03:06.40]Someone is lying very still
[03:06.40]有人静卧再无生息
[03:11.49]He has laughed and he has cried
[03:11.49]他曾欢笑也曾哭泣
[03:16.58]He has fought and he has died
[03:16.58]他曾战斗直至逝去
[03:21.53]He's just the same as all the rest
[03:21.53]与旁人并无二致
[03:26.52]He's not the worst he's not the best
[03:26.52]不算最糟 亦非最佳
[03:30.23]
[04:32.73]And still this ceaseless murmuring
[04:32.73]无休止的絮语仍在继续
[04:38.10]The babbling that I brook
[04:38.10]我忍受着喋喋不休
[04:43.03]The seas of faces eyes upraised
[04:43.03]人海仰起万千面孔
[04:48.08]The empty screen the vacant look
[04:48.08]空白银幕 空洞眼眸
[04:53.33]A man in black on a snow white horse
[04:53.33]雪白骏马上的黑衣人
[04:58.39]A pointless life has run its course
[04:58.39]无意义人生已到尽头
[05:03.52]The red rimmed eyes the tears still run
[05:03.52]红眼眶里泪仍奔流
[05:08.27]As he fades into the setting sun
[05:08.27]随他没入落日残阳
[05:12.04]
